; bal -V --unrealized must foot to zero when two lots of one commodity are
; bought on the same day at different costs.  The price history keeps one
; AAPL price per timestamp, so the first purchase, valued at the day's
; last price ($160) rather than at its cost ($150), carried a $100 gap
; into the report total.  This failure predates 75c9c37a5.

2024/01/01 Buy
    Assets:Brokerage        10 AAPL @ $150
    Assets:Checking

2024/01/01 Buy
    Assets:Brokerage        10 AAPL @ $160
    Assets:Checking

P 2024/03/01 AAPL $170

test bal -V --unrealized
                $300  Assets
               $3400    Brokerage
              $-3100    Checking
               $-300  Equity:Unrealized Gains
--------------------
                   0
end test

test bal --exchange $ --unrealized
                $300  Assets
               $3400    Brokerage
              $-3100    Checking
               $-300  Equity:Unrealized Gains
--------------------
                   0
end test

test bal -G
                $300  Assets:Brokerage
end test
